HST Office: entry points of "Tài liệu chưa lưu" (documents closed without saving, kept 7 days).

- sfx2 startcenter.ui + backingwindow: a "Tài liệu chưa lưu" button under Tài liệu gần đây / Mẫu.
- sfx2 hstbackstage.ui + hstbackstagewindow: the same on the Info page of the File panel, after "Phiên bản
  trước". Both run org.hst.office.vi:UnsavedDocuments of the bundled extension (the classic File menu gets
  the command from the extension's Addons.xcu, after Tài liệu gần đây). Labels of HST commands are
  Vietnamese in every UI language.

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
Test: tests/unit/test_recovery_durability_patches.py; tests/runtime/check-unsaved-documents.py.
---
